OL,3,GNEWSAAmazon drone deliveries granted
OL,4,Ahuge extension
OL,5,
OL,6,FAmazon's drone delivery service has
OL,7,Fbeen given permission to expand from
OL,8,F600 eligible households to 8,000.
OL,10,FThe Civil Aviation Authority (CAA) has
OL,11,Fextended the licence for the service,
OL,12,Fknown as Prime Air, to cover a wider
OL,13,Farea of Darlington where drones have
OL,14,Fbeen operating since May.
OL,16,FPeople with a garden, yard or driveway
OL,17,Fin the area served by the drones have
OL,18,Fbeen able to get deliveries in less
OL,19,Fthan an hour on eligible items that
OL,20,Fweigh less than 5lb and can fit into a
OL,21,Flarge shoebox.
OL,23,APub: 10-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB NE Eng NewsC Reg TVF Weather
