OL,3,GNEWSAAmazon drone deliveries granted
OL,4,Ahuge extension
OL,5,
OL,6,FAmazon said the new, higher level Sail
OL,7,F4 validation from the CAA, which allows
OL,8,Fdrones to fly further and across urban
OL,9,Fareas, would mean more customers
OL,10,Freceived items "quickly, safely and
OL,11,Freliably".
